---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Nadtoka AI"
  description="From trucking to car sales to a manicure studio to AI automation — how Vlad Nadtoka got here."
>
  <section class="fade-up">
    <span class="text-label">About</span>
    <h1 class="text-hero" style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 44px;">Hi, I'm Vlad.</h1>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule-strong" />

  <section class="fade-up text-body" data-delay="1" style="max-width: 620px;">
    <p>
      Started as a truck driver, built a trucking company. Then car sales, insurance. Then a
      manicure studio and painting company. Each one taught me something the last one didn't.
    </p>
    <p>
      Now I'm building Nadtoka AI in Austin, TX — using AI to help small business owners and
      agents run leaner, faster operations. The tools have changed. The goal hasn't: build
      something that runs without you having to babysit it.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've been building businesses for more than 10 years. AI is just the latest tool in the
      toolkit — and by far the most powerful one I've found.
    </p>
    <p>
      The whole point is autonomy. More time with family. Fewer hours staring at a screen.
      That's what I build for myself, and that's what I help others build.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
